IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P9-gate`
IMPORT `P9-art-102-110`

-- Tests for Article 110. Expected values are written from the text of Article 110 and Article 113(d) (Articles 102 to 110 apply from
-- 27 July 2026 as amended; as enacted the general date, 2 August 2026, so before 27 July 2026 nothing applies on any reading),
-- never copied from the encoding's output.

-- args: date asked, the action is a representative action within the meaning of Directive (EU) 2020/1828, the action concerns an infringement of this Regulation
#ASSERT `Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` (Date 28 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
